{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "PLAYER ROOM VARIANTS -- Infinite Fusion has 7 copies of the player's room,",
    "one per character outfit. Common Events 19/99/101 route to the correct map",
    "based on Variable 52 (gender) and Variable 99 (outfit code).",
    "",
    "Map 48:  Male, outfit 13-15  (already in pallet_town.json)",
    "Map 67:  Female, outfit 13-15",
    "Map 68:  Male, outfit 10-12",
    "Map 69:  Female, outfit 10-12",
    "Map 70:  Male, outfit 16-17",
    "Map 71:  Female, outfit 16-17",
    "Map 73:  Default/legacy (outfit <10 or >17) -- different event layout",
    "",
    "Maps 67, 68, 71 share identical event IDs with Map 48 (minus bookshelves).",
    "Maps 69, 70 have an extra TV on Event 5.",
    "Map 73 has a different layout: console=E5, beds=E6/E7, news TV=E2, TV=E4."
  ],
